 sync page (frontend 06:30Z item 7)

The last import that brought contacts (from migration 106's record), how
many it brought, how many numbers the person holds now, and the monthly
reminder switch (migration 233, off by default). The reminder push itself
is not built: its text waits for Misho's yes, so the switch is only saved.

